- Schedule C (Profit or Loss from Business) — to report the $15,000 contracting income and business expenses (including home office)
- Schedule SE — to compute self‑employment tax
- Form 8829 — if you use the actual expense method to compute the home‑office deduction (not required for simplified method)
- Form 8995 (or 8995‑A) — to claim the QBI deduction if applicable
